	"name": "Magical Maestro",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/tools/instruments/lute-gold-brown.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Others have learned to expect the unexpected when you are around. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Strength, Wisdom, or Charisma increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain an expertise die to your Performance skill. Your maximum expertise die size for Performance increases to a d12. You also gain a Performance skill specialty. It does not count against your skill specialties known.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with all musical instruments and gain an expertise die to checks using a musical instrument.</p></li><li><p>You learn a 3rd- or 4th- level spell from the bard, cleric, or warlock list. It counts as a bard spell for you, and does not count against your spells known.</p></li><li><p>You learn an additional battle hymn from the 9th-12th list. It does not count against your battle hymns known. </p></li></ul><p>Once you have selected this feat, you can no longer gain levels in classes other than bard.</p>",
